{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Destination"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each record this destination receives adds to its context."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"enricher"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that hands this one each batch with its records enriched."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: ownBackend.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[RegionKey.self] = \"eu-west\" }),","    vendor",")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher runs on each record of a batch as the delivery hands the batch to this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, not on the tracker’s worker, so what it sets reaches this destination alone:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the others are handed the same records without it. It runs on every record the destination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives, records a store recovered from an earlier run included, and reads any value it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"computes at delivery rather than when the event was tracked. So it suits values about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination or the delivery, such as a region or a deployment tag, rather than about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event: a recovered record would get this run’s app version and the network at upload time."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"first","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sees what ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set and has the last word on a key both set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" adds ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionStarted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") enricher calls for a batch of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" records.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination\/enriched(by:)"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Destination","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","title":"enriched(by:)","externalID":"s:12Destinations11DestinationPAAE8enriched2byQr6Events8EnricherV_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:12Destinations18ConsoleDestinationV","extendedModule":"Destinations","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Enriched.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Enriched.swift#L34"}},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by ","type":"text"},{"code":"enricher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/consoledestination\/enriched(by:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Destination":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Destination","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Destination","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a delivery sends events: a plain sink that records the batches it receives."}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/destination","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/ConsoleDestination":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"ConsoleDestination","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConsoleDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/consoledestination","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that prints each event on a line of its own: its name, then the value.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsoleDestination","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/ConsoleDestination/enriched(by:)":{"title":"enriched(by:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/consoledestination\/enriched(by:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Destination"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination\/enriched(by:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enricher"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where tracked events go: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destination"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches."}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"Destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Enricher","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered."}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"}}}